</table>
<p>Dense phase does not mean the whole line runs dense. Gas expands as pressure drops along the pipe, so the tail end of a dense phase line can run in dilute phase. Material testing decides which mode a given powder will run in reliably.</p>
<h2 id="compare-heading">Types of Pneumatic Conveying Systems</h2>
<p>Phase and air source combine into four system types.</p>
